<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 92,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 92,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Friday were 92,000 head, compared with the estimate of 90,000, USDA said.</p>
<p>Saturday's actual was 9,000 head, compared with the estimate of 15,000.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts $1.00 per cwt higher than midsession Friday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
